[ ] Accessibility checked
[ ] Tests added
[ ] Build passes
[ ] Diff reviewed
[ ] Documentation updated
```

---

# 109. Screen Completion Checklist

Every AEGIS screen should eventually satisfy:

```text
[ ] Correct route
[ ] Correct information hierarchy
[ ] Correct data
[ ] Correct components
[ ] Correct states
[ ] Correct interactions
[ ] Correct navigation
